! Silicon in the diamond structure, LDA, norm-conserving, with its symmetry kept,
! so the density has the inversion centre exactly. It is the control for a
! second-order response, since inversion makes chi^(2) and the shift current zero.
 &control
    calculation = 'scf'
 /
 &system
    ibrav = 2, celldm(1) = 10.2, nat = 2, ntyp = 1,
    ecutwfc = 12.0
 /
 &electrons
    conv_thr = 1.0d-10
 /
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 Si 28.086 Si.pz-vbc.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
 Si 0.00 0.00 0.00
 Si 0.25 0.25 0.25
K_POINTS (automatic)
 4 4 4 0 0 0
